{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, move to it. If grabbed, move to destination and do task. Scan area. If battery low, recharge. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectGrabbed    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PerformTask    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = RechargeBattery    />\"",
